    <div id="vsb_content" class="content"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: 等线 Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: 等线;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #4472C4;  --docx-accent2-color: #ED7D31;  --docx-accent3-color: #A5A5A5;  --docx-accent4-color: #FFC000;  --docx-accent5-color: #5B9BD5;  --docx-accent6-color: #70AD47;  --docx-hlink-color: #0563C1;  --docx-folhlink-color: #954F72;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx table, table.docx_4 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}p.docx_2 {  text-align: left;}p.docx_2 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}p.docx_2 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}p.docx_3 {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}p.docx_3 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}p.docx_3 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_6 {  color: #0000FF;  text-decoration: none;}p.docx_7 {  text-indent: 21.00pt;  text-align: justify;}p.docx_7 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_8 {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}p.docx_8 span {  font-family: Arial;  display: none;  min-height: 8.00pt;  font-size: 8.00pt;}span.docx_9 {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_9 p {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}span.docx_9 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}span.docx_10 {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_10 p {  text-align: left;}span.docx_10 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}span.docx_11 {  color: #605E5C;  background-color: #E1DFDD;}span.docx_12 {  font-family: TimesNewRoman;  color: #000000;  min-height: 11.00pt;  font-size: 11.00pt;}span.docx_13 {  color: #605E5C;  background-color: #E1DFDD;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 18px;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16px;"><span style="min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16px;">西安电子科技大学是以信息与电子学科为主，工、理、管、文、经等多学科协调发展的全国重点大学，隶属于教育部，是国家“双一流”建设高校，国家双创示范基地之一、首批33所特色化示范性软件学院、首批9所示范性微电子学院、首批9所获批设立集成电路人才培养基地和首批一流网络安全学院建设示范项目的高校之一。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16px;"><span style="min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16px;">根据教育部办公厅《关于进一步做好第二学士学位教育有关工作的通知》（教高厅函〔2021〕8号）和《关于在普通高校继续开展第二学士学位教育的通知》（教高厅函〔2020〕9号）等文件要求，为更加适应新形势下我国的经济建设与事业发展，培养更高素质的复合型、应用型人才，为高校毕业生创造更多再学习机会，增强学生就业创业能力。结合我校实际情况与专业特色，经研究，决定招收2026年第二学士学位学生。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; min-height: 16pt;">一、报名条件</span></strong></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16px;"><span style="min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16px;">1.拥护党的领导，热爱祖国，遵纪守法，品德优良；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; min-height: 16pt;">2.</span><span style="font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt;">报考我校第二学士学位的考生须为西安电子科技大学全日制普通高等教育本科毕业并获得学士学位的2026年应届毕业生，报名考生须在入学报到前（入学报到时间以我校公布为准，下同）取得本科毕业证和学位证，未在入学报到前取得证书的考生将被取消录取资格；</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16px;"><span style="min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16px;">3.理工文科兼招，同等条件下优先录取第一专业为工科类的考生；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16px;"><span style="min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16px;">4.身体健康，有较强的组织活动能力和独立自主、开拓创新的能力，符合《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》（教学〔2003〕3号）的相关规定。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; min-height: 16pt;">二、招生计划与专业</span></strong></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16px;"><span style="min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16px;">根据学校实际情况与招生总规划，确定2026年招收第二学士学位生共计120名，学制两年。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; font-size: 16px;"><span style="min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16px;">1.招生专业及咨询方式：</span></p><table class="docx_4" style="width: 738px; table-layout: fixed; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><colgroup><col data-offset-left="269.8153381347656" data-offset-right="317.92613220214844" data-resize-pixel="48.11079406738281" data-resize-percent="6.519077786908241" style="width: 6.5191%;"><col data-offset-left="317.9261169433594" data-offset-right="388.210205078125" data-resize-pixel="70.28408813476562" data-resize-percent="9.523589178152523" style="width: 9.5236%;"><col data-offset-left=