family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 8pt; font-size: 8pt;">080902</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="line-height: 3; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 8pt; font-size: 8pt;">软件工程</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span class="docx_12" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 8pt; font-size: 8pt;">计算机科学与技术学院</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="line-height: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span class="docx_12" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 8pt; font-size: 8pt;">2年</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="line-height: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span class="docx_12" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 8pt; font-size: 8pt;">20人</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span class="docx_12" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 8pt; font-size: 8pt;">总学分不高于80学分，每生每学分不超过400元</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span class="docx_12" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 8pt; font-size: 8pt;">张老师</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span class="docx_12" style="font-family: &quot;Time